# ran off the edges, and g_app.scale clamped at 1.0. On Android the floor is 0.5, and the scaled frame buffer is used for
# any factor other than 1.0, so a fraction draws a bigger interface and shrinks it to the screen (linear filter, as for
# every fraction). Overlay game_chaosuiscale (L.phoneFactor) asks for it. Desktop builds keep 1.0 as the floor.
